    title: "BRICS countries support AI in education and student mobility",
    excerpt: "The BRICS New Delhi Declaration 2026 places artificial intelligence, digital literacy, and international student mobility at the forefront of global education cooperation.",
    category: "Global Education News",
    readTime: "4 min read",
