    id: "the-indian-education-trap-clarity-session",
    slug: "the-indian-education-trap-clarity-session",
    title: "The Indian Education Trap: Why Your Child Needs a Mentor, Not Just Another Tutor",
    excerpt: "We push our kids into the competitive rat race of coaching centers, but are we actually setting them up for real-world success? Discover the power of the 1-on-1 Clarity Session.",
    category: "Mentorship",
